      "content": "thanks for that. one thing that's worrying me is the \"unseen\" side of it. like, some of these airports have weird rules about transferring terminals or picking up bags that you don't see on the standard sites. how do we make sure we aren't caught off guard by those little bureaucratic hurdles that might get someone flagged or held up?), can you give some advice on how to handle those tricky, unexpected requirements that often pop up at the gate?",
